@startuml SALUD_Module_30_read_models
title Module 30 — Frontend View Contracts, Routes and Read Models\n(schema: read_models)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide circle

note as BIZ
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Provides frontend-ready, permission-aware read contracts. Every page binds to a
  route, a versioned read model, field metadata, filters, sorting, actions, KPIs and
  explicit loading/empty/error/forbidden/stale states. Views return display-ready
  labels and stable codes without exposing ORM models, secrets or unnecessary PHI.
end note

